# Environment Variables Configuration

## Required Environment Variables

### Database Configuration
```
Database_url=mongodb+srv://username:password@cluster.mongodb.net/behonest?retryWrites=true&w=majority
```
MongoDB connection string for your database.

---

### JWT Authentication
```
access_token_secret=your-super-secret-access-token-key-minimum-32-characters
refresh_token_secret=your-super-secret-refresh-token-key-minimum-32-characters
```
**Important:** Generate strong random strings (32+ characters). Never commit these to version control.

---

### Cloudinary (Image Storage)
```
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your-cloud-name
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=123456789012345
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=your-api-secret-key
```
Get these from your [Cloudinary Dashboard](https://cloudinary.com/console).

**Note:** Ensure your Cloudinary account supports:
- Authenticated uploads (for original image storage)
- Image transformations (for privacy redaction)

---

### CORS & Allowed Origins
```
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-frontend-domain.com,https://www.your-frontend-domain.com
NODE_ENV=production
```
Comma-separated list of allowed frontend URLs for CORS.

For development:
```
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:5174
NODE_ENV=development
```

---

### Admin Account (Superadmin Seed)
```
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@yourdomain.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=secure-admin-password-here
```
Used to create initial superadmin account on first server start.
**Important:** Change the password after first login!

---

### Email Service (Nodemailer)
```
EMAIL_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
EMAIL_PORT=587
EMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your-app-specific-password
EMAIL_FROM=noreply@yourdomain.com
```
For Gmail: Use [App-Specific Password](https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/185833).

---

### Razorpay (Payment Gateway)
```
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxx
RAZORPAY_SECRET_KEY=your-razorpay-secret-key
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-webhook-secret
```
Get these from [Razorpay Dashboard](https://dashboard.razorpay.com/).

---

### Google Gemini AI (Optional - for AI features)
```
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key
```
Get from [Google AI Studio](https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey).

---

### Server Configuration
```
port=8000
```
Server port (default: 8000). Render will use PORT from environment automatically.

---

## Quick Setup for Render.com

1. Go to your Render dashboard
2. Select your service → Environment
3. Add all variables above with your actual values
4. Click "Save Changes"
5. Render will automatically redeploy

---

## Security Notes

⚠️ **Never commit .env files to Git**
- Add `.env` to `.gitignore`
- Use different secrets for development and production
- Rotate secrets periodically (especially after team changes)

✅ **Best Practices**
- Use strong, randomly generated secrets (minimum 32 characters)
- Enable 2FA on Cloudinary, MongoDB Atlas, and Razorpay accounts
- Use read-only database users where possible
- Monitor access logs regularly

---

## Verification Checklist

After setting environment variables:

- [ ] MongoDB connection succeeds (check Render logs)
- [ ] Cloudinary uploads work (test image upload)
- [ ] JWT tokens are generated correctly (test login)
- [ ] Email notifications send (test signup)
- [ ] Razorpay webhooks receive events (test payment)
- [ ] CORS allows your frontend domain (test API calls)
- [ ] Admin account created (check on first deployment)

---

## Troubleshooting

**MongoDB Connection Failed:**
- Check Database_url format
- Verify IP whitelist in MongoDB Atlas (allow 0.0.0.0/0 for Render)
- Ensure database user has read/write permissions

**CORS Errors:**
- Verify ALLOWED_ORIGINS includes exact frontend URL (with protocol)
- Check for trailing slashes (be consistent)
- Ensure credentials: true in both server and client

**Cloudinary Upload Failed:**
- Verify API credentials are correct
- Check account quota/limits
- Ensure authenticated upload type is enabled

**JWT Authentication Failed:**
- Ensure secrets are properly set (no quotes, no spaces)
- Check token expiration times
- Verify cookie settings (httpOnly, secure, sameSite)

---

## Environment-Specific Configs

### Development (.env.local)
```
NODE_ENV=development
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:5174
DATABASE_URL=mongodb://localhost:27017/behonest-dev
```

### Staging (.env.staging)
```
NODE_ENV=staging
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://staging.yourdomain.com
```

### Production (.env.production)
```
NODE_ENV=production
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://yourdomain.com,https://www.yourdomain.com
```
